== Tips ==
* A '''Hideonsun''' can throw its bullet through blocks, and the player can shoot it back through blocks as well.
* Wearing a {{Item|Cow Hat}} grants immunity to the Levitation effect inflicted when hit by a projectile from a '''Hideonsun'''.
* [[Fishing Net]]s have a relatively large hitbox and can be used to deflect the '''Hideonsun'''{{'}}s projectiles.

